description:
Tentukan output program berikut, lalu susun baris output sesuai urutan kemunculannya:
```
public class ArithmeticDemo {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        int a = 10;
        int b = 3;
        System.out.println(a + b);
        System.out.println(a - b);
        System.out.println(a * b);
    }
}
```
